&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a Reporting &amp;amp; Data Analyst to help Form3 develop a more reliable, scalable and accessible reporting capability across the organisation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
